    <header/>
    <body>
      <trans-unit id="simplecmp.parent"><source>SimpleCMP</source><target>SimpleCMP</target></trans-unit>

      <trans-unit id="mlang_tabs_tab"><source>SimpleCMP banner design</source><target>SimpleCMP-Banner-Design</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="mlang_labels_tablabel"><source>Customise the consent banner</source><target>Einwilligungs-Banner anpassen</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="mlang_labels_tabdescr"><source>Configure the colors, typography, and corner radius of the SimpleCMP consent banner per Site Set. Changes apply to the next frontend page render.</source><target>Farben, Typografie und Eckenradius des SimpleCMP-Einwilligungs-Banners pro Site Set konfigurieren. Änderungen werden mit dem nächsten Frontend-Aufruf wirksam.</target></trans-unit>

      <trans-unit id="designer.title"><source>Banner design</source><target>Banner-Design</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.intro"><source>Customise how the SimpleCMP consent banner looks on your site. Each Site Set has its own theme; changes take effect on the next frontend page render.</source><target>Passe das Aussehen des SimpleCMP-Einwilligungs-Banners auf deiner Website an. Jedes Site Set hat sein eigenes Design; Änderungen werden mit dem nächsten Frontend-Aufruf wirksam.</target></trans-unit>

      <trans-unit id="designer.sitePicker.label"><source>Site</source><target>Site</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.sitePicker.customBadge"><source>Custom theme active</source><target>Eigenes Design aktiv</target></trans-unit>

      <trans-unit id="designer.group.brand"><source>Brand colors</source><target>Markenfarben</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.group.surface"><source>Text &amp; background</source><target>Text &amp; Hintergrund</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.group.advanced"><source>Advanced colors</source><target>Erweiterte Farben</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.group.typography"><source>Typography</source><target>Typografie</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.group.shape"><source>Shape</source><target>Form</target></trans-unit>

      <trans-unit id="designer.field.color-primary"><source>Primary color (Accept button background)</source><target>Primärfarbe (Hintergrund des Akzeptieren-Buttons)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.color-primary-hover"><source>Primary hover (Accept button hover state)</source><target>Primärfarbe Hover (Hover-Zustand des Akzeptieren-Buttons)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.color-text"><source>Body text</source><target>Fließtext</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.color-text-muted"><source>Muted text (descriptions, hints)</source><target>Dezenter Text (Beschreibungen, Hinweise)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.color-bg"><source>Card background</source><target>Kartenhintergrund</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.color-bg-alt"><source>Alternate background (badges, required-pill)</source><target>Alternativhintergrund (Badges, Pflicht-Marker)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.color-border"><source>Border</source><target>Rahmen</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.color-danger"><source>Decline color</source><target>Ablehnen-Farbe</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.font-family"><source>Body font family (CSS font-family stack)</source><target>Fließtext-Schriftfamilie (CSS-font-family-Stack)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.font-family-heading"><source>Heading font family</source><target>Überschrift-Schriftfamilie</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.font-size"><source>Body font size (px or rem)</source><target>Fließtext-Schriftgröße (px oder rem)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.font-size-heading"><source>Heading font size (px or rem)</source><target>Überschrift-Schriftgröße (px oder rem)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.field.radius"><source>Corner radius (e.g. 6px)</source><target>Eckenradius (z. B. 6px)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.action.detectFonts"><source>Detect fonts from active site</source><target>Schriften der aktiven Site erkennen</target></trans-unit>

      <trans-unit id="designer.preview.title"><source>Live preview</source><target>Live-Vorschau</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.preview.help"><source>The consent banner updates as you edit. Click Configure inside the banner to see the modal with all services.</source><target>Das Einwilligungs-Banner aktualisiert sich beim Bearbeiten. „Konfigurieren" im Banner anklicken, um den Dialog mit allen Diensten zu sehen.</target></trans-unit>

      <trans-unit id="designer.action.save"><source>Save theme</source><target>Design speichern</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.action.reset"><source>Reset to defaults</source><target>Auf Standard zurücksetzen</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="designer.action.reset.confirm"><source>Discard this site's custom theme and revert to the SimpleCMP defaults?</source><target>Eigenes Design dieser Site verwerfen und auf SimpleCMP-Standards zurücksetzen?</target></trans-unit>
    </body>
